WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:08.800
Part twelve: paperwork review. Check each new document right on your phone, and mark it OK, needs fix, or rejected.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:14.045
Hub tools is on the admin home screen. The red numbers show what's waiting.

00:00:14.245 --> 00:00:16.560
Tap Paperwork to review.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:22.509
Every new document, oldest first: who it's for, the type, where it came from, and when.

00:00:22.709 --> 00:00:24.870
Tap one to open it.

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:30.521
Tap Show file. It opens right here, so you don't need access to the Hub's Drive.

00:00:30.721 --> 00:00:32.321
Check the name and the date.

00:00:32.521 --> 00:00:34.990
Open full size to zoom in.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:40.811
Make sure the type is right. Emailed documents come in with no type, so pick one.

00:00:41.011 --> 00:00:47.689
Check the date and when it expires. Levy documents get Levy's contract date if you leave Expires blank.

00:00:47.889 --> 00:00:50.322
ATC permits need the permit number.

00:00:50.522 --> 00:00:56.700
Tap OK, it counts. The volunteer is cleared as soon as everything they need is OK.

00:00:57.550 --> 00:01:00.580
Saved, and the next document opens by itself.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:05.858
If something's wrong, type what to fix. The volunteer sees this reason on their page.

00:01:06.058 --> 00:01:08.149
Needs fix asks them to redo it.

00:01:08.349 --> 00:01:13.590
Rejected means it won't be accepted at all. Both are logged with your name.
